# 📝 ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values
# NEVER commit .env to git - it's already in .gitignore

# === Supabase Configuration ===
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="your-project-id-here"
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project-id.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="your-anon-public-key-here"

# === Payment Configuration ===
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="your-stripe-publishable-key-here"

# ⚠️ IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES:
# 
# 1. SECRET KEYS ARE NEVER STORED IN .env
#    - Paystack Secret Key → Stored in Supabase Dashboard > Edge Functions > Secrets
#    - Service Role Key → Stored in Supabase Dashboard > Edge Functions > Secrets
#    - These run server-side only and are never exposed to browsers
#
# 2. PUBLIC KEYS (prefixed with VITE_) are safe to expose
#    - They're designed to be used in frontend code
#    - They have built-in security restrictions
#
# 3. HOW TO SET SUPABASE SECRETS:
#    Run: supabase secrets set PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxxxx
#    Or add them in: https://supabase.com/dashboard > Your Project > Edge Functions > Secrets
